        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Manasseh King of Judah",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Manasseh was twelve years old when he became king, and he reigned in Jerusalem fifty-five years.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He did evil in the eyes of the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "2CH.33.2",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "2CH.33.2"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", following the detestable practices of the nations the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "2CH.33.2",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "2CH.33.2"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "had driven out before the Israelites.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He rebuilt the high places his father Hezekiah had demolished; he also erected altars to the Baals and made Asherah poles. He bowed down to all the starry hosts and worshiped them.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He built altars in the temple of the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "2CH.33.4",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "2CH.33.4"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", of which the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "2CH.33.4",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "2CH.33.4"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "had said, \"My Name will remain in Jerusalem forever.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "In both courts of the temple of the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "2CH.33.5",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "2CH.33.5"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", he built altars to all the starry hosts.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He sacrificed his children in the fire in the Valley of Ben Hinnom, practiced divination and witchcraft, sought omens, and consulted mediums and spiritists. He did much evil in the eyes of the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "2CH.33.6",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "2CH.33.6"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", arousing his anger.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He took the image he had made and put it in God's temple, of which God had said to David and to his son Solomon, \"In this temple and in Jerusalem, which I have chosen out of all the tribes of Israel, I will put my Name forever.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I will not again make the feet of the Israelites leave the land I assigned to your ancestors, if only they will be careful to do everything I commanded them concerning all the laws, decrees and regulations given through Moses.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But Manasseh led Judah and the people of Jerusalem astray, so that they did more evil than the nations the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "2CH.33.9",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "2CH.33.9"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "had destroyed before the Israelites.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "2CH.33.10",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "2CH.33.10"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "spoke to Manasseh and his people, but they paid no attention.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "So the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "2CH.33.11",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "2CH.33.11"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "brought against them the army commanders of the king of Assyria, who took Manasseh prisoner, put a hook in his nose, bound him with bronze shackles and took him to Babylon.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "In his distress he sought the favor of the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "2CH.33.12",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "2CH.33.12"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "his God and humbled himself greatly before the God of his ancestors.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And when he prayed to him, the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "2CH.33.13",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "2CH.33.13"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "was moved by his entreaty and listened to his plea; so he brought him back to Jerusalem and to his kingdom. Then Manasseh knew that the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "2CH.33.13",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "2CH.33.13"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "is God.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Afterward he rebuilt the outer wall of the City of David, west of the Gihon spring in the valley, as far as the entrance of the Fish Gate and encircling the hill of Ophel; he also made it much higher. He stationed military commanders in all the fortified cities in Judah.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He got rid of the foreign gods and removed the image from the temple of the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "2CH.33.15",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "2CH.33.15"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", as well as all the altars he had built on the temple hill and in Jerusalem; and he threw them out of the city.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then he restored the altar of the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "2CH.33.16",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "2CH.33.16"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and sacrificed fellowship offerings and thank offerings on it, and told Judah to serve the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "2CH.33.16",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "2CH.33.16"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", the God of Israel.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The people, however, continued to sacrifice at the high places, but only to the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "2CH.33.17",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "2CH.33.17"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "their God.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The other events of Manasseh's reign, including his prayer to his God and the words the seers spoke to him in the name of the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "2CH.33.18",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "2CH.33.18"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", the God of Israel, are written in the annals of the kings of Israel.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "His prayer and how God was moved by his entreaty, as well as all his sins and unfaithfulness, and the sites where he built high places and set up Asherah poles and idols before he humbled himself—all these are written in the records of the seers.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Manasseh rested with his ancestors and was buried in his palace. And Amon his son succeeded him as king.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Amon King of Judah",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amon was twenty-two years old when he became king, and he reigned in Jerusalem two years.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He did evil in the eyes of the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "2CH.33.22",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "2CH.33.22"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", as his father Manasseh had done. Amon worshiped and offered sacrifices to all the idols Manasseh had made.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But unlike his father Manasseh, he did not humble himself before the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "2CH.33.23",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "2CH.33.23"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "; Amon increased his guilt.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amon's officials conspired against him and assassinated him in his palace.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then the people of the land killed all who had plotted against King Amon, and they made Josiah his son king in his place.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
